        "       WRITE lv_timestamp TIME ZONE lv_timezone TO lv_comment_header.
* concatenate comment header separated by space
*        IF ls_comment_ext-full_name IS NOT INITIAL.
*          CONCATENATE lv_comment_header
*                      '-'
*                      ls_comment_ext-full_name
*                      INTO lv_comment_header
*                      SEPARATED BY space.
*        ENDIF.

*        CONCATENATE lv_comment_header ls_separator INTO lv_comment_header.
* concatenate comment header separated by space
        IF ls_comment_ext-full_name IS NOT INITIAL.
          user = ls_comment_ext-full_name.
        ELSE.
          user = lv_creator.
        ENDIF.

        EXIT.
      ENDLOOP.
    ENDIF.

    lv_comment_header = |{ timestamp } - { dpnotes } |.


    l_tablename = 'ZPS_ARPARTNER'.

    CREATE DATA lo_table_ref TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF (l_tablename).

    CHECK lo_table_ref IS NOT INITIAL.

    ASSIGN lo_table_ref->* TO <dynamic_table>.
    CHECK <dynamic_table> IS ASSIGNED.
    CLEAR l_sel_val.
    l_sel_val = 'P3'.
